{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:de84a4e651fc9419","name":"Master Scout Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-de84a4e651fc9419","title":"Master Scout Talent Tree","revision":21378,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T01:41:22Z","sha256":"59b6a11ed07444f17e611c6083d70950e8ec0ee6dd629e534303ac68e40070c0","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=21378","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Master%20Scout%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-de84a4e651fc9419","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are more experienced and talented than the average ",{"tag":"a","children":["Scout"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Scout","referenceId":"reference:8a1db462be753774"},". You draw upon your diverse abilities to gain advantages others cannot match.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Piercing Hit"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Acute Senses"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acute_Senses"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Keen Shot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Keen_Shot"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You are skilled at fighting armored characters, taking advantage of their weaknesses. You can use each of the following actions once per encounter:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Binding Hit:"]}," You dislodge an enemy's armor, causing it to hinder the wearer's defenses. Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},". If you hit and damage your target, the target loses its Armor bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," and is ",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},". This effect remains until the target spends a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"}," to adjust its armor."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Blinding Fire:"]}," Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},". If the attack hits and damages the target, the target takes a -2 penalty to all attacks until the end of your next turn. Additionally, all other creatures, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droids"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droids","referenceId":"reference:6e72e583603b9ea8"},", and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicles"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicles"}," have ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concealment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concealment"}," from the target until the end of your next turn."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Slowing Shot:"]}," Your hit damages your target's armor so that the target's movement is hindered. Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},". If you hit and damage the target, the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speed","referenceId":"reference:c372fee9b4566b85"}," is reduced by two squares until the end of your next turn."]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Quicktrap"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jury-Rigger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jury-Rigger"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Tripwire"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can use the ",{"tag":"b","children":["Tripwire"]}," Talent as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"}," instead of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Speedclimber"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Long Stride"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Long_Stride"}]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Surefooted"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surefooted"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You do not suffer penalties when using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Accelerated Climbing"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Accelerated_Climbing"}," application of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Climb"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Climb","referenceId":"reference:98ca5f27d9642dc7"}," skill.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Surprisingly Quick"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skill Focus (Initiative)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skill_Focus_(Initiative)"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["In a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"},", if you are not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"},", you can take a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"}," in addition to the one other ",{"tag":"a","children":["Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Action"}," normally allowed. If you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"},", you can take a single ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Normal:"]}," In a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprise Round"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprise_Round"},", if you are not ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"},", you can take a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Move Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Move_Action"},", or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},". If you are ",{"tag":"a","children":["Surprised"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Surprised"},", you can take no ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"},".\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Tripwire"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Trained"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Trained"}," in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"},", ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Jury-Rigger"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jury-Rigger"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", you can set up a simple snare or trap across an opening up to 3 squares wide. You must have the required items to set the trap. Make a successful DC 20 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mechanics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mechanics","referenceId":"reference:1c74a0e2ceaaeb28"}," check to set the trap. Make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check to conceal the wire. Compare the result of the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check of the next creature that passes through that square (-10 if it observes you setting the trap).\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["If the creature fails the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," check, it takes the indicated use of the trap. If the creature succeeds, it can make a DC 10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Acrobatics"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Acrobatics","referenceId":"reference:0d0b7eee2953750e"}," check to avoid the wire. Select one of the following options:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Clothesline:"]}," Requires thin wire, set at neck height. Success results in the target falling ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"}," in the trapped square, ending its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"}," for the turn and taking 1d6 points of damage."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Electronic Tripwire:"]}," Success results in ",{"tag":"a","children":["Mine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Mine?action=edit&redlink=1"}," damage (treat as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Frag Grenade"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Frag_Grenade","referenceId":"reference:5d38df4b2da8b77e"},", 2-square blast radius centered on one end of the wire). Target is automatically hit; roll 1d20+10 against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of adjacent targets."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Tripwire:"]}," Requires thin wire, set at ankle height. Add 2 to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Deception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Deception","referenceId":"reference:17455029fb9994a3"}," check result. Success results in the target immediately falling ",{"tag":"a","children":["Prone"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Prone","referenceId":"reference:4d99dff1fb964110"}," in the trapped square and ending its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Actions"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Actions","referenceId":"reference:ff8059dc6752afdd"}," for the turn."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
